And now we're doing the Ultimate Office rewatch podcast just for you.

6
00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:19.410
Each week, we will break down an episode of The Office and give exclusive behind-the-scenes stories that only two people who were there can tell you.

7
00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:20.570
We're The Office ladies.

8
00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:23.370
I love it.

9
00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:24.790
Creed is here.

10
00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:25.630
Creed is here.

11
00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:26.510
Creed is here.

12
00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:27.970
Creed is in the house.

13
00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:28.350
Yeah.

14
00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.350
This is so amazing.

15
00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:34.030
Creed's going to be with us for the whole episode, guys.

16
00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:38.610
Okay, Creed, you are our first in-house visitor, right?

17
00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:41.550
I mean, we've had people call in, but you're our first in-house gueSt.

18
00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:42.730
I'm the first one.

19
