537
00:18:57.860 --> 00:19:02.620
I think it really, like, I think it touches on something.

538
00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:05.520
He really doesn't want to hurt someone else.

539
00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:05.780
Yep.

540
00:19:05.900 --> 00:19:06.760
That's exactly right.

541
00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:07.140
Yeah.

542
00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:09.480
So it's deeper than that, just unpopularity thing.

543
00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:11.340
I was moved by his performance in that, yeah.

544
00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:12.040
Same.

545
00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:14.540
I mean, yeah, he crushed it.

