00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:43.940
I get the Joker.

553
00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:44.740
The Joker.

554
00:19:44.980 --> 00:19:45.880
When I walk in, it's the Joker.

555
00:19:46.180 --> 00:19:50.000
And then when Brian comes, damn it, Creed, and he hip-checks you.

556
00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:51.560
No, that's a later episode.

557
00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:51.860
Later.

558
00:19:51.860 --> 00:19:53.320
