00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:08.640
It was so—and the skirt didn't quite fit me.

603
00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:10.140
And it kept, like, heading south.

604
00:21:10.140 --> 00:21:12.520
I had to keep, like, grabbing it and yanking it up.

605
00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:14.940
It almost ruined the whole episode, that whole cat thing.

606
00:21:15.240 --> 00:21:15.820
It did.

607
00:21:16.300 --> 00:21:21.540
I think now there was such a big meeting about your hair that my cat costume was just like,

608
00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:22.860
eh, just put this on her.

609
00:21:23.020 --> 00:21:26.460
But you ended up wearing that costume, like, two more times.

610
