00:22:00.520 --> 00:22:01.480
You didn't deserve three.

628
00:22:03.140 --> 00:22:04.820
They decided to give me less.

629
00:22:05.040 --> 00:22:05.220
Yes.

630
00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:06.940
I have to—

631
00:22:06.940 --> 00:22:07.980
That's a height reference.

632
00:22:08.280 --> 00:22:08.460
Yeah.

633
00:22:09.980 --> 00:22:15.620
While we're talking about this scene in accounting, I have to point out that we don't often—our

634
00:22:15.620 --> 00:22:20.320
camera guys didn't often do, like, a full character slow pan, you know?

635
00:22:20.480 --> 00:22:20.700
Uh-huh.

636
00:22:20.700 --> 00:22:23.120
And they do such a hilarious one.

637
00:22:23.300 --> 00:22:29.460
They start at Kevin's feet, and they go all the way to his head while he's filing to get

638
00:22:29.460 --> 00:22:31.760
him in full red leotard.

639
00:22:31.900 --> 00:22:35.560
With his socks all misbulging in wrong areas.

640
00:22:35.600 --> 00:22:36.340
Oh, my gosh.

641
00:22:36.340 --> 00:22:36.940
It's great.

642
00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:37.320
It's great.

643
00:22:37.440 --> 00:22:39.040
There's a great slow pan of Kevin.

644
00:22:39.220 --> 00:22:42.440
We should say, we loved dressing up in these Halloween costumes.

645
00:22:42.440 --> 00:22:42.800
Oh, yeah.

646
00:22:43.020 --> 00:22:46.740
Because our outfits normally were pretty boilerplate.

647
00:22:47.120 --> 00:22:49.640
It was almost like we wore uniforms in a way.

648
00:22:49.640 --> 00:22:53.760
And our wardrobe people loved, loved—the wardrobe crew loved getting to dress us, because

649
00:22:53.760 --> 00:22:55.340
they—it was just like, great turtleneck.

